# Nd(III) for use with SPC/E water and CL&P.
# 12-6 Lennard-Jones parameters, IOD set for SPC/E water, from
#   P. Li, L. F. Song, K. M. Merz Jr., J. Phys. Chem. B 2015, 119, 883-895.
#   doi:10.1021/jp505875v
# Converted to CL&P units (A, kJ/mol) from the R_min/2 and epsilon(kcal/mol)
# reported there.
#
# THIS IS NOT A CL&P PARAMETER. Two things must be checked before any number
# that depends on it is presented:
#   1. run Stage 3a and confirm the Nd-O(water) first peak comes out near
#      2.4-2.5 A with a coordination number near 8-9;
#   2. read the combining rule. CL&P mixes sigma geometrically (fftool default);
#      the Li-Merz set was fitted with Lorentz-Berthelot arithmetic mixing.
#      The difference is small for a single ion but it is a real approximation
#      and belongs in your methods slide.

ATOMS
#     typ   m/u      q/e    pot   pars
Nd    Nd   144.242  +3.00   lj    2.9952   0.52569
